Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经把萨福克派去北部了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you dispatched suffolk to the north?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.46,0:01:25.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是的 陛下 - 您怎么对他说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, your majesty. - what did you say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:28.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我规劝他应该做至高无上的陛下之忠实骑士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I urged him as a true knight to his sovereign lord not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.61,0:01:33.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不应心存怜悯 而应毫无留情地弑杀那些不义叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To spare but frankly to slay plenty of these false rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:34.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对他说处死叛国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said to him there was no need for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:37.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根本不必客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Courtesy in shedding the blood of traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:38.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:43.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西班牙国王很快将派遣一名官方特使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The emperor will shortly be dispatching an envoy with authority to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:44.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前来与陛下商讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Discuss with your majesty possible
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.69,0:01:47.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽小姐未来夫婿人选事宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Candidates for the hand of the lady mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}觉得此船如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:56.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是仪典船 威尼斯总督的官船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's the bucintoro, the doge's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:02:00.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}建成之后 王后将乘坐此船前往加冕典礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When it is built, the queen will ride in it to her coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.35,0:02:05.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那必将是一次万世流芳的盛典\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then it will indeed be a memorable occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:08.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 不过还得等到我儿出生之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course, it will have to wait until after the birth of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:10.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一份文扎 广泛传播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is a pamphlet, widely distributed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:17.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作者是陛下认识的 瑞金纳德·珀尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Its author is reginald pole, of your majesty's acquaintance,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:21.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他新近被罗马主教任命为红衣主教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who has lately been made a cardinal by the bishop of rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:27.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红衣主教 上面说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A cardinal? what does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:31.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}文中出言中伤陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It condemns your majesty in the vilest terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:35.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 说我什么 - 说您是异教徒 以及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- As what? - as a heretic, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:40.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通奸者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...as an adulterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就这么心存感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So much for gratitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:51.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有更糟糕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunately, there is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:55.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的人还告诉我 这个珀尔红衣主教当下正以教皇使节的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My creatures tell me that the same cardinal pole is now in france,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:03:00.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出访法国 并私下面见了法王弗朗西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As papal legate and has been granted private audience with king francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:03.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很显然 他正试图挑唆法国及其他国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apparently, he is trying to persuade the french, and others,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:07.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出力协助叛军重起反对陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To help rekindle the rebellions against your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.70,0:03:19.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每年 威尼斯总督乘坐此船前往泻湖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every year, the doge of venice travels out in this ship, into the lagoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面向大海重宣婚姻誓词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To renew his marriage vows with the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与大海联姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marriage with the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:29.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪个君王不想要如此强大的情人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What prince does not aspire to have such an elemental mistress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:48.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗伯特·阿斯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. robert aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您被指控合谋颠覆国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been accused of conspiring to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:53.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为教会最高统治之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deprive the king of his title of head of the church
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.06,0:03:58.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并迫使陛下组建议会 以及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of seeking to compel him to hold a parliament; and finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:01.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}策发起兵叛乱之罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of levying war against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:06.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这皆是在陛下仁慈宽恕尔等叛乱之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All after his majesty's gracious pardon was granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:10.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}综上原因我们判您有罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On all these counts we find you guilty as charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:13.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您将被送回约克郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are to be returned to york,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:17.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在你等疯狂作乱之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where you enjoyed your most frantic triumph
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:20.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您将被施以绞刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and there hanged in chains as a punishment
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.61,0:04:25.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以惩您犯上作乱之重罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for your grievous sins against his majesty's highness and against this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:40.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马已备好 公爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your horse is ready, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:46.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:48.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:51.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道您将履行您的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you will do your duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:57.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢您 好了 去检查马匹吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you. now, go check on the horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:10.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不指望您的祝福 凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't ask for your blessing, catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:14.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只请您别心存诅咒送我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't send me away with your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:18.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是可敬之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a man of honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.91,0:05:24.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我祈求上帝永远不要令我有理由诅咒和冒犯您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I pray to god I shall never have cause to curse or disoblige you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:29.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我恳求您 仁慈一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I beg you, show mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:32.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其是对那些无辜之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Especially to the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拉尔夫·埃利卡爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir ralph ellerker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:53.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拉尔夫爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir ralph...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:57.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您被指控参与最近一起阴谋叛乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are accused of taking part in the late insurrection that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:06:00.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恶意反对国王陛下及整个王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So wretchedly offended his king's majesty and the whole realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}鉴于您在法庭上的陈词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have taken account of your deposition into the court
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即您是出于对您自身及您家眷的人身安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That you only joined the rebels out of fear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的考虑而参与叛乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For your own life and the lives of your dependants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:12.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时鉴于您归案后发誓悔改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We also note your subsequent vows of contrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我们要求您签署此文书 - 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- We ask you to sign this. - what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:19.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}誓词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:22.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您发誓对冒犯陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You swear that you are heartily sorry that you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.13,0:06:25.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参与叛乱诚心悔改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have offended the king's highness in this rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:28.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您保证绝不集结非法军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You promise never again to make unlawful assembly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.09,0:06:32.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并保证将此告知其余所有参与此事之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And also promise to inform against anyone else who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:38.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从今往后 您将做我们的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From henceforth, you shall be a true and faithful subject unto our king,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至高无上的亨利八世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our sovereign lord henry the eighth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:42.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国和法国国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King of england and of france
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:46.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国教会在世间最高统治者的忠实子民 上帝保佑您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and on earth supreme head of the church of england, so help you god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:51.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样 国王陛下将仁慈地宽恕您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in return, his majesty will grant you mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:34.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 那人还在动 - 杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- That one's moving! -  finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让路 那边的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way!  you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:49.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们都停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.39,0:07:51.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别做了 听到没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop your labors, do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:54.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...of the king! make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.05,0:07:56.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停止劳动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cease your labors!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.20,0:07:58.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stop it, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:01.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尔等皆乃叛国罪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are traitorous villains. all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法律和天意俱规定尔等应归顺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were bound, by law and by nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:09.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵从国王陛下之旨意 而尔等却追随叛贼阿斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To obey the king's majesty and yet you followed the traitor aske
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:12.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你才是叛国之人 - 犯下谋逆陛下之重罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You're the traitors!  - ...and rose in unholy rebellion against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:14.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尔等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:22.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我来此是要向那些冥顽不灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it is my purpose here to show a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:24.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不顺从最高尚庄严的陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fearful example to those who would disobey
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.91,0:08:31.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}示以最严厉的惩罚 因为陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His most gracious and sacred majesty, who after all, in his mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾仁慈地宽恕过尔等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Granted you a pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:38.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而尔等却一意孤行违抗陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whereupon you continued your willful disobedience and traitorous hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:44.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}综上原因 陛下不会再原谅尔等 上帝也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For these reasons, the king will not forgive you. and neither will god!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:19.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.87,0:09:48.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在天上的父 愿人都尊你的名为圣 愿你的国降临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our father, who art in heaven hallowed be thy name, thy kingdom come,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.69,0:09:54.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿你的旨意行在地上如同行在天上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thy will be done, on earth as it is in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:14.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 求您原谅您可怜的仆人 对您子民所犯的罪过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, lord, forgive thy poor servant, his trespasses against your flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.23,0:10:28.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 我叫理查德·柯文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. aske, my name is richard curwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.98,0:10:33.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是授命牧师 我是来听您忏悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am an ordained priest, and I have come to hear your confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.92,0:10:38.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可否如实相告 柯文先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I speak to you honestly, mr. curwen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:44.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拜托您 不要辜负我的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, do not betray my trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.66,0:10:48.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不会 阿斯克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never, mr. aske.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:20.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明日 我不仅要向陛下祈求原谅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow, I must beg the forgiveness not only of his sacred majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:24.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要向克伦威尔和其他异教徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But also of cromwell and the other heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:30.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这让我备感屈辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It sticks in my craw...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:36.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔公开宣称我们所有北方人都是叛国者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cromwell has openly said that all us northerners were traitors...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:41.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这令我气愤不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It offended me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:48.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他多次让我求饶 招供所谓的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And then, several times, he offered me a pardon, for confessing the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:52.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔是恶魔的使者 柯文先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cromwell is the devil's messenger, mr. curwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:57.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我却必须求得他的宽恕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet, I must beg his pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:04.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然他们就会伤害我家人 此乃我绝不允许的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or else they will hurt my family, and that I cannot allow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:08.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸的是我妻子孩子将看着我被绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bad enough that my wife and children will see me hanged,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:12.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尸首在铰链上慢慢腐烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And left to rot in these chains.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:17.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿斯克先生 您有何需要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. aske, is there anything you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:20.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要我能办到的 以此给予您最后的安慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anything I can get you, for solace?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:29.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再无任何慰藉了 柯文先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There can be no solace, mr. curwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:33.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我再坐着独自抽泣会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will sit here awhile, and weep,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:42.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后我将投身到上帝的手中 被他的慈爱所包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And thereafter deliver myself into god's hands and into his loving mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:53.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以圣父及圣子及圣灵之名 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In nomine patris, et filii, e et spiritus sancti. amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.66,0:12:59.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等 有样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait. there is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:02.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}缝在我领子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sewn into my collar there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是玛丽小姐给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was given that by the lady mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.01,0:13:24.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于对我们起义的支持 柯文先生 请将它交给我妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you love our cause, mr. curwen, please hand it to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:27.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这能大大减轻她的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will ease her burden greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}her majesty the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.66,0:14:50.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·布莱恩爵士觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sir francis bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:57.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Majesty.  - sir francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:09.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瑞金纳德·珀尔昭显了他的野心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reginald pole has shown us his true heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.67,0:15:14.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我命您前往巴黎 就法国国王对他热烈盛大的接待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to go to paris, protest to the french king, on our behalf,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:17.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}提出我们的抗议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the solemn and pompous reception granted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵旨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.59,0:15:22.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要求他将叛国者交给您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ask him to deliver the traitor into your hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:27.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则我们将会是永久的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or face the consequences and our perpetual enmity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果法王拒绝了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if the king refuses?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:37.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您从前不也曾是间谍吗 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were you not a spy once, sir francis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:41.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾经是 陛下 确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was, your majesty. indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.63,0:15:43.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也绝非循规蹈矩之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a breaker of codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:47.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 或许您可以用一些您过往的伎俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, perhaps you could revisit some of your old skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:49.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本人乐意见到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I for one would like nothing better than
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:52.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珀尔被五花大绑着送去加来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To have pole trussed up and taken to calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.51,0:15:57.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好是活抓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'd rather alive than dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:11.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:29.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掌玺大臣在干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is the lord privy seal doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:33.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜那些贵族想从他那购买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I imagine those nobles want to buy the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:35.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些被废修道院的租契\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leases of some of the suppressed abbeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们给克伦威尔先生什么回报呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are they giving mr. cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.16,0:16:41.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贿赂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bribes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.17,0:16:44.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生早已十分富有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. cromwell is already a rich man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:46.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人说他富可敌国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some say the richest in the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:49.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王知道他们的勾当吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does the king know of this practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要他能拿到10%的分红\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He asks no questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:53.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王便不再过问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As long as the crown receives its 10 percent share.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:58.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们神圣的场所被人用来攫取财富 这难道不可悲吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it not terrible that our sacred building be used like this for profit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:05.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您非这么说 但您得了解其中的奥妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you say so.  then you have you have to understand how clever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:08.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通过允许这些新兴贵族在国内购置产业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By allowing these new men to buy a stake in the kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:15.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生才能确保他们对国王及对他自己的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}mr.Cromwell makes sure of their loyalty to the king and to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 别这样 - 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- stop!  - I have to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.29,0:17:49.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 所以呢 - 所以我等不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- So?  - so, I can't go until I've had you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:53.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.63,0:17:56.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就喜欢疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I like madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行 太危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No... it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:04.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我丈夫会看到我们的 我万一怀上了怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband might see us. what if I were to conceive your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:07.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那又怎样 很多女人都隐瞒了孩子的生父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So what? lots of women lie about the fathers of their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:11.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多你一个不多 让爱德华来养我的孩子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it matter to you? let edward raise my brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.80,0:18:17.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}承认吧 女士 你也很喜欢这游戏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Admit it, lady, this is your game too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:24.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.04,0:18:34.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}约克城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}York Castle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:47.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father. father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出去 快 把他们带出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out! go on, take them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:58.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可怜的丈夫 我可怜的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, my poor husband! my poor husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:04.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么 为什么他们要如此对你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why? why have they done this to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:09.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为我祈祷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pray for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:16.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我罪有应得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:20.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:24.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你罪不至此 别拉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not deserve this! stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.21,0:19:27.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是好人 罗伯特·阿斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are a good man, robert aske!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:12.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你们为我祈祷吧 因为我触犯了上帝 国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you to pray for me for I have greatly offended god, the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及天下苍生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:20.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝 我因打破太多诫命而冒犯了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God, I have offended by breaking his commandments in many ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:24.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我因触犯法律而冒犯了国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the king I have offended by breaking his laws
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.47,0:20:30.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以上帝的旨意每个忠诚的子民都应遵从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to which every true subject is bound by the commandment of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.29,0:20:34.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我因自己的行为而冒犯了天下众生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the world I offended since, for my actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.55,0:20:39.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他们因此而丧生 失去家园和财物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So many have lost their lives, their lands, and their goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:43.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我恳请上帝宽恕吾王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask forgiveness of his grace, his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.47,0:20:48.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也宽恕掌玺大臣 大法官大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Also, my lord privy seal, my lord chancellor...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:52.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及萨福克大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my lord of suffolk,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.90,0:20:57.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以我自由之心宽恕他对我犯下的罪行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whose trespasses against me I also forgive with a free heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:06.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我热爱天下苍生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I love all the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:41.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此事之后我国疆土将一片祥和 宁静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This realm goes from good peace and quiet, daily,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.16,0:21:43.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}日趋昌盛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.46,0:21:46.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛国贼均已被处死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The traitors have been executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:49.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达西勋爵在塔山处死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lord darcy at tower hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.32,0:21:55.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿斯克则绞死在约克的地牢城堡之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Aske hanged above the dungeon of the castle at york.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:22:00.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其余众人在伦敦行刑场处以极刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rest were executed at tyburn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.26,0:22:08.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前之势来看 所有的心头之患\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that, as far as we can perceive, all the cankered hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:11.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}均已铲除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are weeded away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.83,0:22:24.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诺曼底 法国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Normandy, France
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.40,0:22:28.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像这样 对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like this. exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.01,0:22:35.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·布莱恩爵士吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}e sir francis bryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:37.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}容我自我介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me present myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.41,0:22:39.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是塔利隆伯爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am count talleyrand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.14,0:22:41.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法王弗朗索瓦派我来见您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty king francois has sent me to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.95,0:22:44.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯爵大人 让我为您介绍我的同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Count, Let me present my companion
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.59,0:22:46.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯·西摩先生 英国王后的兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. thomas seymour, the brother of the queen of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.34,0:22:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.86,0:22:53.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然国王派您来见我们 您想必知道我们此行目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So if the king has sent you, you know why we have come to france?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.23,0:22:56.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 是的 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oui, oui. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.29,0:22:59.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们希望贵国政府履行条约义务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And that we expect your government, under its treaty obligations,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.85,0:23:02.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}逮捕反叛者瑞金纳德·珀尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To apprehend the rebel reginald pole
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:04.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并将其引渡至我方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and deliver him into our custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:07.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很不巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:12.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下已给这位瑞金纳德·珀尔颁发了通行证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty already granted safe passage to this reginald pole...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.12,0:23:16.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以将他交予贵国 我国颜面何在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So it would have been dishonorable for him to hand him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.46,0:23:20.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 陛下在十天前曾修书致贵国国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nevertheless, he promised your king by letter, ten days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:23.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信中承诺他将驱逐这位珀尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That he would expel this pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:26.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 他也做到了 - 那么珀尔现在人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And so he did.  - then where is pole now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:31.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据我说知 他被准许前往卡塞塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All I know is that he was allowed to travel to caserta,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.71,0:23:33.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该地属西班牙国王的管辖之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Under the emperor's jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.94,0:23:42.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我看来你们处事的方式十分之古怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to me that your manner of proceeding has been very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:46.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕这会破坏两国国王之间的友谊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it may lose your master the friendship of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:49.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 我饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.15,0:23:52.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 伯爵大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good evening, count.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.09,0:23:56.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安 弗朗西斯爵士 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good evening, sir francis. monsieur. e oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.13,0:23:59.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}[法语]假日愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and bonnes vacances.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:05.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}E monsieur...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.39,0:24:07.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们的晚餐 请用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gentlemen, your meal, if you please
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.25,0:24:18.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 很好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes, very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:23.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 卡塞塔在哪儿 恕我愚昧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So, where's caserta? forgive my ignorance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.44,0:24:27.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在意大利 那不勒斯的北边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In italy. north of naples.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.08,0:24:29.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是个可爱的老城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a nice old town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.01,0:24:32.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉你汤姆 要是让我们抓着珀尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell you this Tom, If we find pole,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:34.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我才不会捆他回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not truss him up...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.28,0:24:37.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要亲手结果他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to kill him with my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.39,0:24:46.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 尤斯泰斯·查普伊斯大使阁下觐见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty his excellency, ambassador eustace chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:52.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:55.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下 王后陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesties.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.19,0:24:57.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我主陛下向您们致以问候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The emperor sends you his love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.89,0:25:01.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并赋予我重任 命我前来商讨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he has charged me with the grave responsibility of negotiating
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:05.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下的爱女玛丽小姐的亲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your majesty a suitable marriage for your daughter, the lady mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:08.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王的人选为谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who does the king propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.15,0:25:10.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唐·路易斯殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His highness don luis,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.49,0:25:12.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}葡萄牙王位继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The heir to the throne of portugal
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.36,0:25:14.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是我主王后伊莎贝拉之弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the brother of the emperor's wife, Isabella.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.13,0:25:18.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个唐·路易斯 为人怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What type of man is he, this don luis?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.52,0:25:21.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在各方面堪称完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is in every way a paragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.11,0:25:24.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}品行端正 德操高尚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man of great integrity and virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.80,0:25:27.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}骁勇善战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man who has fought military campaigns and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.84,0:25:30.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}学识渊博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man with a profound knowledge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:33.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我女儿尚不晓世事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My daughter has no knowledge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:36.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她纯洁无瑕 天真无邪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she is an inocence, an innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.85,0:25:40.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她超凡脱俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And she is a very spiritual person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.07,0:25:42.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这唐·路易斯将如何待她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How will this don luis treat her?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.02,0:25:45.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奉为圣女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Like a nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.59,0:25:49.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此一来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case, alas,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.63,0:25:52.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也甭指望他们有后代了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it may be difficult for them to produce children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.08,0:26:01.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.51,0:26:15.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}西班牙国王为您提了一宗好亲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The emperor has suggested a splendid offer for your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.31,0:26:19.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唐·路易斯殿下时年二四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His highness don luis is twenty four years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:24.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出身高贵 家财万贯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From a very rich and distinguished family.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.52,0:26:27.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.21,0:26:32.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说他在西班牙国王宫廷深得人心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am told he is a great favorite at the imperial court.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.95,0:26:37.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深得女人芳心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With... women?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.16,0:26:38.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.25,0:26:44.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他卓越不凡风流倜傥且斯文有礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he is so honorable and gallant and good natured.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.52,0:26:47.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.05,0:26:49.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长相端正吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}...good looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.23,0:26:51.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:54.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲眼见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have seen him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.42,0:27:00.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他玉树临风 有一头乌发和炯炯有神的蓝眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is tall, with very dark hair but piercing blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:06.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信您母亲 愿主安抚她的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am sure that your mother, god rest her soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.38,0:27:08.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也会应允这门亲事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would have approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.19,0:27:16.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宫里的人都在议论您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And everyone at court is talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.20,0:27:18.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们说王后劝服了陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They say the queen has persuaded his
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.81,0:27:22.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将恢复您为合法继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty to reinstate you to the succession.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.49,0:27:32.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜那罗伯特·艾斯克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Poor robert aske...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.99,0:27:38.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}据说他仍负枷 悬尸示众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was told his body is still hanging, trimmed in chains, for all to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.96,0:27:42.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能只顾自己幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should not be thinking of my own happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.39,0:27:46.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好心的小姐 您追求幸福是理所应当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweet madam, you have every right to think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.21,0:27:52.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人们 身为教会领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your graces, as head of the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.18,0:27:55.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为你们无法在教旨与修行这等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am vexed by your inability to agree on
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.35,0:27:58.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}基本问题达成共识深感失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fundamental issues of doctrine and practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:28:01.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我聆听你等的传道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I listen to your sermons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.54,0:28:03.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不时觉得 你们的福音宣教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And sometimes, I find them full of...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.92,0:28:07.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无头绪 无法被认可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Evangelical excesses which have never been Agreed upon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.69,0:28:11.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更不能为英国教众接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and have no place in the church of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.05,0:28:17.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人们 我要教会内部达成一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your graces, I want unity and agreement in our church.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.72,0:28:22.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要再有教义分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want diversity of opinion ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.61,0:28:24.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要推行统一的教宗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and uniformity imposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.47,0:28:26.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:30.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我特命你等成立委员会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I command you to establish a commission amongst
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:35.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拟定我国教会之基本教义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yourselves to determine the basic articles of our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.33,0:28:37.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's her majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.20,0:28:45.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 何事 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- What is it? -  your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.67,0:28:48.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宝贝儿 什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.37,0:28:50.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.29,0:28:54.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.60,0:29:01.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感觉到了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.13,0:29:04.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.04,0:29:07.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在踢我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.44,0:29:12.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能感觉到 他结实着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can feel it. he feels strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.32,0:29:23.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华 我儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Edward, my son...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.95,0:29:27.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很强壮的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.17,0:29:45.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赌一克朗我下一条我钓到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A crown I catch the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.95,0:30:01.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it, father?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.28,0:30:07.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你没看到他吗 - 看到谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Can't you see him? -  see who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:10.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.50,0:30:12.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看不到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can't you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.26,0:30:17.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 看啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.93,0:30:24.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我 你能见到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me you can see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.93,0:30:27.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那男子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.05,0:30:29.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.08,0:30:34.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看到他了 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can see him, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.89,0:30:39.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在老天的份上 你看到他了么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For god's sake, do you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.80,0:30:44.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没多久 王后的胎儿就足月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In a while, the queen will come to full term.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.67,0:30:47.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要您去筹备我儿降生的庆祝会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to organize the celebrations for the birth of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.35,0:30:49.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深感荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.66,0:30:53.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庆祝会要无比壮观 在王国各地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want them to be truly spectacular; te deums and
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.31,0:30:55.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}礼拜颂歌 燃起焰火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bonfires throughout the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.22,0:30:56.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有免费畅饮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and free wine for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:58.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并比试剑术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:31:00.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前王后若诞下王子 我也曾打算办剑术比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had planned a tournament for the birth of a prince with my last queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.75,0:31:03.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但最后只得作罢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it had to be cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.72,0:31:07.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这回陛下可没理由不办了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This time your majesty will have no reason to cancel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.59,0:31:12.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我另有一事请教陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I ask your majesty's opinion on another matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.01,0:31:15.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近期的叛乱 感谢上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the recent rebellion which, thank god,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.67,0:31:17.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下已镇压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}your majesty has now suppressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.59,0:31:19.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并已处死首恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the worst rascals properly put to death
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.23,0:31:22.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛贼谋反主要是为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}great cause was made by
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.21,0:31:24.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反对掌玺大臣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some against the lord privy seal,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:28.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此次祸端多因归咎于他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who in some quarters was blamed for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.68,0:31:32.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说实话 我们觉得他身陷凶险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Frankly we thought him in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.99,0:31:34.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我们深信错不在他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whilst trusting he was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.43,0:31:46.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叛乱分子要克伦威尔的首级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was the rebels who demanded mr. cromwell's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.96,0:31:51.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然如此 我们就越要保住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And by doing so, they saved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.36,0:32:04.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 罗切福特夫人 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, lady rochford? - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.75,0:32:06.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}利尔斯夫人致信于我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady lisle has written to me asking
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.19,0:32:08.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问我王后陛下能否在您的宫廷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if your majesty might find a place in
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.22,0:32:10.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给她两个女儿中的的一个安排职位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your household for one of her two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.65,0:32:12.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉她会向您禀报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told her I would mention it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.60,0:32:15.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是否警告过利尔斯夫人宫廷生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you warned the lady lisle that life at court is full of pride, envy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.89,0:32:17.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充满傲慢 嫉妒 轻蔑和嘲笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Scorn, and derision?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.31,0:32:20.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您已经告诫过她们 就让她们来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you have, then send them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.34,0:32:22.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会选一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I'll choose one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.79,0:32:24.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请记住 准备两套衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And remember,there must be two sets of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.69,0:32:26.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一套用绸缎做 另一套用锦文布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}one of satin, the other of damask.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.09,0:32:29.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.34,0:32:33.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米索顿女士 请帮我解开长袍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady misseldon, help me unlace my gown.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.26,0:32:36.90,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}衣服好像每分每秒都在变小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to grow tighter by the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.35,0:32:44.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若我有什么不测 请为我安慰陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If anything should happen to me, be a comfort to his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.86,0:32:50.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.75,0:32:52.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam! majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.01,0:32:54.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别慌 女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not be alarmed, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.67,0:32:57.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想分娩时辰到了 玛丽女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I think my time has come. lady mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.37,0:32:58.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.79,0:33:01.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请发誓守着我 不要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}please swear that you will stay with me now and not forsake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.51,0:33:04.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.59,0:33:07.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就好了 快去请助产士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then all will be well. go fetch the midwife.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.35,0:33:11.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到床上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come to the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.05,0:33:13.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.95,0:33:15.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是时候了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well? is it time?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.86,0:33:18.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.26,0:33:21.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请我的御医去照看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send my physician to watch over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.89,0:33:24.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 是 陛下 - 再请彼奇大人过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, your majesty. - and fetch my lord beauchamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.11,0:33:26.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 加德纳主教也一并请去 - 是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And bishop gardiner. - majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.11,0:33:28.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再派些使者到城里去告知这个消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And send some heralds into the city to tell them the news!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.60,0:33:32.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有克伦威尔 通知克伦威尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And cromwell. tell mr. cromwell...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.29,0:33:37.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他 所有事宜留待商榷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him... tell him that whole worlds hang in the balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.08,0:33:39.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生产时间到了 生产时间到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's happening! it's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:44.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祈求耶稣 请赐予我们王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray jesus, if he wills, to send us a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.60,0:33:53.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me have a look now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.51,0:34:00.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求主引领我们 给我们救助 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Domine adjutor et protector noster, adjuva nos. amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.15,0:34:02.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求主引领我们 给我们救助 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Domine adjutor et protector noster, adjuva nos. amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:07.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深呼吸 陛下 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Breathe deep, your majesty. good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.46,0:34:09.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 玛丽女士 - 是的 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lady mary. - yes, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.13,0:34:11.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The box.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.16,0:34:34.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它曾属于您母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It used to belong to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.22,0:34:38.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想她与我们同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think she is here, with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.16,0:34:44.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全心全意的相信 她会帮助您的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe with all my heart she will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.43,0:35:00.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全能永恒的主啊 请对病痛者发发慈悲吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Almighty and everlasting god, mercifully look upon our infirmities,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.43,0:35:03.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我们陷入危险 孤立无援时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in all our dangers and necessities,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.89,0:35:09.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请伸出您的手来帮助我们保护我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stretch forth thy right hand to help us and defend us,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.46,0:35:13.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的主耶稣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through christ our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.38,0:35:17.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}使劲儿 四指了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've got to push. all four fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.26,0:35:24.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.36,0:35:35.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天将全城举行一场庄严的游行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow there will be a solemn procession through the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.26,0:35:40.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有人为王后祈祷 如果她还在生产中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All to pray for the queen if she is still in labor with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.22,0:35:44.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果她还在生产中 上帝保佑我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If she is still in labor with child, god help us...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.14,0:35:50.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我害怕会失去他们两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think to lose them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.63,0:36:30.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我诚心归顺上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am reconciled with god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.83,0:36:34.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有做违背良心的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have done nothing against my conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.80,0:36:43.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听命于国王就是听命于上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To serve the king is to serve god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.51,0:36:49.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.84,0:37:10.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还没有好转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is no better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.43,0:37:31.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求您了 夫人 别放弃啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, my lady. don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.47,0:37:34.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在耶稣的份儿上 别放弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, for the love of jesus, don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.57,0:37:42.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我和御医们商量了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty, I talked to the physicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.82,0:37:45.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们认为不剩多少时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In their opinion there is not a great deal of time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.64,0:37:49.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他们不尽快为王后切腹取出胎儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The baby is likely to die unless they
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.42,0:37:52.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}胎儿很可能会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cut open the queen's belly to release it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.69,0:37:59.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此一来 王后本人很可能就保不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In which case, it is almost certain that she herself will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.22,0:38:04.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下您得尽快决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty may thus have to decide soon
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.68,0:38:10.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是保母亲 还是保孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Between the life of the mother or of the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.91,0:38:24.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳求主怜悯我们 恳求主怜悯我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kyrie, eleison;  kyrie, eleison.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.70,0:38:27.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耶稣怜悯我们 耶稣怜悯我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Christe, eleison;  christe, eleison.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.44,0:38:54.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.79,0:39:05.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:23.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下产下了 一名健康的男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her majesty is delivered... of a healthy son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.18,0:39:33.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.82,0:39:37.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have a son!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.78,0:39:39.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.00,0:39:42.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您有儿子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.21,0:40:06.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国未来的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And a future king of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.97,0:40:35.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝福你 我的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bless you, sweet child.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.84,0:40:56.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华 我们的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Edward, our son...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.38,0:41:07.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以上帝 圣母玛利亚和圣乔治之名 祝福你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bless you, child, in the name of god, the virgin mary, and st. george.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.18,0:41:28.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个可爱的王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a sweet prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.43,0:41:31.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 而且他是我们的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yes, he is. - and he's our brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.18,0:41:34.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王盼儿子盼好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king has waited a long time for a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.48,0:41:36.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他仍然爱我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he still loves us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.95,0:41:41.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}男孩更重要一些 伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A boy is more important, elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.44,0:41:43.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看未必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.20,0:41:58.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以上帝 圣子和圣灵的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the name of the father, son, and holy ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.63,0:42:01.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为爱德华施洗礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I baptize thee edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.71,0:42:06.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但愿上帝会在你有生之年庇佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May god bless and keep you all the days of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.12,0:42:08.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给予你他无穷的恩惠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And give you abundantly his grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.05,0:42:11.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的主耶稣 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through jesus christ our lord. Amen
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.31,0:42:14.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.76,0:42:18.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全能慈悲的主啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God, of his almighty and infinite grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.52,0:42:22.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请赐予至高无上的王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give and grant good life and long to the right high,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.51,0:42:28.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时也是康沃尔公爵及切斯特伯爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}right excellent,and noble prince edward, duke of cornwall and earl of chester,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.43,0:42:33.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们最威严高尚的国王亨利八世的爱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}most dear and entirely beloved son to our most dread and gracious lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.92,0:42:35.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爱德华王子长命百岁 永享尊荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}king henry the eighth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.25,0:42:41.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后的病情在急速恶化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The queen's health has rapidly deteriorated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.66,0:42:43.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚 她已经能够排便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yesterday evening she had a loosening of
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.40,0:42:46.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时我们感觉肯定可以救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bowels and we felt sure we could save her...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.34,0:42:50.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但夜里她发热更严重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But during the night her fever grew worse again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.61,0:42:53.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们试了所有的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have tried everything we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.36,0:42:58.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 王后仍然越来越虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But... her majesty continues to weaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.12,0:43:17.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是产褥热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's childbed fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.47,0:43:21.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道这个是因为我母亲是这么去世的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know because my mother died of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.81,0:43:28.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出去 退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get out... leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.84,0:43:35.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.26,0:43:37.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.15,0:44:37.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.06,0:44:42.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求求你 别走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please, don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.85,0:44:46.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就因为你兑现了你的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just because you have done everything that you promised,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.18,0:44:50.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}求你别离开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.20,0:44:57.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你充满着恻隐之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are the milk of human kindness
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.27,0:45:06.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我黑暗世界里的明灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the light in my dark, dark world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.01,0:45:14.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有了你 人生就是荒漠 是旷野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without you life is a desert; a howling wilderness.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.13,0:45:29.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝啊 显显慈悲吧 别把她从我身边带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Please god, in your mercy, don't take her away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.55,0:45:37.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的儿子需要他的母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My son needs his mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.51,0:45:42.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也需要我的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I need my queen.
